(24, 'Addlink S20 120GB 2.5\" SATA III 6Gb/s 3D Nand SSD', 1, 1, 16, 'uploads/images/25-11-2021/619f91508163b.png', 'C39', 'S20', 0, 0.00, '0', 3.00, '0', 1.00, NULL, 'youtube', NULL, '<ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; display: block; line-height: 20px;\"><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">Addlink S20 120GB 2.5\" SATA III 6Gb/s 3D Nand SSD</h2><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(1, 19, 45); line-height: 26px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">Addlink S20 SSD comes with 120GB 2.5\" SATA III 6Gb/s capacity and built in with 3D NAND flash technology. The Addlink S20 achieves exceptional transfer speeds of up to 510MB/s read and 400MB/s write. Easy upgrade for speeding up computer performance. This Addlink SSD has built-in SmartECC and SmartRefresh for state of the art data retention and ensures continued reliable data transfer.</p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">Exceptional Performance</h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(1, 19, 45); line-height: 26px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">This Addlink S20 SSD gives you Exceptional Performance with the taking full advantage of the SATA III 6Gb/s interface and built in with 3D NAND flash, and also the S20 SSD achieves exceptional transfer speeds of up to 510MB/s read and 400MB/s write.</p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">S20 SATA III 6Gb/s:</h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(1, 19, 45); line-height: 26px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">Addlink S20 SSD comes with the latest 3D NAND technology that features vertical expansion of storage cells. By using only high-quality flash chips and enhanced firmware algorithms, the S20 SSD is guaranteed to provide greater performance and reliability.</p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">The latest 3D NAND Technology</h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(1, 19, 45); line-height: 26px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">This Addlink SSD featured with 3D NAND technology. The 3D NAND flash is a type of flash memory, where the memory cells are stacked vertically in multiple layers. This 3D NAND is developed to break through density limitations of the 2D planar NAND, that deliver a greater level of performance and endurance.</p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(1, 19, 45); line-height: 26px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\">The latest Addlink S20 120GB 2.5\" SATA III 6Gb/s 3D Nand SSDcomes with 03 years warranty.</p></li></ul>', '<table class=\"data-table flex-table\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin: -20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 920px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex;\"><td class=\"name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 0 0 250px; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239); color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">Capacity</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239);\">120GB</td></tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex;\"><td class=\"name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 0 0 250px; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239); color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">Form Factor</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239);\">7mm height, 2.5\"</td></tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex;\"><td class=\"name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 0 0 250px; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239); color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">Flash Type</td><td class=\"value\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 1 1 auto; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239);\">3D NAND technology</td></tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: flex;\"><td class=\"name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 10px 20px; flex: 0 0 250px; display: flex; line-height: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(236, 237, 239); color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">Interface</td><td class=\"va