px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 900; font-family: OpenSans; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4K 24p Video*</p><p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.224a5790RBKYNs\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-left: 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; line-height: 20px; font-family: OpenSans; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Capture 4K videos at a frame rate of up to 24p for high definition, cinematic results. Recording at almost four times the resolution of Full HD, you can see your subject in stunning clarity. Beautiful time-lapse videos can also be created in 4K simply and easily with the dedicated Time-lapse Movie mode.<br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px;\"><br style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px;\">* Contrast AF is used for 4K UHD movies.</p></div>', NULL, 1, 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 'nikon-dslr-camera', 0, 1, '2021-10-03 17:55:44', '2021-10-04 09:05:08'),
